Hi,

In 5.4 and 5.8.0-rc6+ kernels I see awful TX performance from the
Ethernet on (at least) MT7623 boards. It's been reported on a Banana Pi
R2, as well as UniElec U7623.

Using iperf3, receiving is fine:

