This is seen with the OpenWrt 5.4 kernel, and also with a clean current
upstream 5.8.0-rc6 (with just one patch from
https://git.openwrt.org/?p=3Dopenwrt/openwrt.git;a=3Dcommitdiff;h=3D3610588=
